    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29354" root="عصل" body-key="E">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عصّل</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْصِيلٌ</span>, <i>It</i>
(an arrow) <i>twisted when shot.</i> (TA. [But see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَصِّلٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also, (AA, O,) inf. n. as above,
(AA, O, K,) said of a man, (AA, O,) <i>He was,</i>
or <i>became, slow, dilatory, late,</i> or <i>backward.</i>
(AA, O, K.)

